---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "September 16, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | BlinkNetworks"
  description="Learn how BlinkNetworks collects, uses, protects and handles personal information submitted through our website."
>
  <article class="privacy">
    <div class="privacy__header">
      <p class="privacy__eyebrow">LEGAL</p>
      <h1 class="privacy__heading">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy__updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy__content">
      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how BlinkNetworks ("BlinkNetworks",
        "we", "us") collects, uses and discloses personal information
        gathered through blinknetworks.com (the "website"), including
        information submitted through our Contact form. This policy is
        intended to reflect principles found in Canadian privacy law,
        including the Personal Information Protection and Electronic
        Documents Act (PIPEDA), and does not constitute a guarantee,
        certification or audit of legal compliance.
      </p>

      <h2>Information You Submit Through Our Contact Form</h2>
      <p>When you use the Contact form, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your full name (required)</li>
        <li>Your work email address (required)</li>
        <li>Your company or organization name (optional)</li>
        <li>Your phone number (optional)</li>
        <li>The service category you select (required)</li>
        <li>The message or inquiry details you provide (required)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Please do not include passwords, payment-card or banking
        information, government identification numbers, health
        information, or other sensitive information in your message. We do
        not need this information to respond to a general business
        inquiry.
      </p>

      <h2>Technical Information</h2>
      <p>
        Like most websites, the infrastructure that hosts blinknetworks.com
        and the service that processes our Contact form may automatically
        process limited technical information, such as IP address, browser
        and device information, requested pages, access times, the
        referring page, and information used to help detect spam or
        security threats. BlinkNetworks does not use this information to
        actively build individual visitor profiles.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>Information submitted through the Contact form may be used to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>respond to your inquiry</li>
        <li>understand the services you are asking about</li>
        <li>prepare or discuss a proposal with you</li>
        <li>provide support or follow-up you have requested</li>
        <li>maintain appropriate business correspondence</li>
        <li>
          help protect the Contact form and website against spam, abuse or
          security threats
        </li>
        <li>meet applicable legal obligations</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Submitting the Contact form does not subscribe you to a marketing
        list or newsletter.
      </p>

      <h2>Service Provider and Processing Outside Canada</h2>
      <p>
        BlinkNetworks uses Formspree, an independent third-party
        form-processing service, to receive and deliver Contact form
        submissions. Formspree is not owned or controlled by BlinkNetworks.
        Submissions and related technical data may be processed or stored
        in the United States or other jurisdictions where Formspree or its
        service providers operate, and information handled outside Canada
        may be subject to the laws of those jurisdictions. You can review
        the <a
          href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >Formspree Privacy Policy (opens in a new tab)</a> for details on
        how Formspree handles information.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclosure of Information</h2>
      <p>
        BlinkNetworks does not sell or rent the information submitted
        through the Contact form. We may disclose information only as
        reasonably necessary to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          service providers that support our website or Contact form
          operations, such as Formspree
        </li>
        <li>
          respond to a lawful request from a court, regulator or other
          authority
        </li>
        <li>
          protect our legal rights, the safety of others, or the security
          of our website
        </li>
        <li>
          complete a business reorganization, such as a merger or sale,
          where the recipient is bound by appropriate confidentiality and
          privacy protections
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain personal information submitted through the Contact form
        only as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose it was
        collected for, to meet legitimate business record-keeping needs, to
        resolve disputes, for security purposes, and to meet applicable
        legal obligations. When information is no longer reasonably needed
        for these purposes, we delete or securely dispose of it where
        reasonably practicable.
      </p>

      <h2>Safeguards</h2>
      <p>
        BlinkNetworks uses reasonable administrative, technical and
        organizational safeguards appropriate to the type of information we
        handle. However, no method of transmission over the internet or
        method of electronic storage can be guaranteed to be completely
        secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>Access, Correction and Deletion Requests</h2>
      <p>
        You may contact us to ask what personal information we hold about
        you, and to request that we correct or delete it. Requests are
        subject to reasonable identity verification and applicable legal or
        operational requirements. To make a request, email{" "}
        <a href="mailto:hello@blinknetworks.com">hello@blinknetworks.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        BlinkNetworks does not currently use advertising cookies or
        website analytics cookies on this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may link to external websites, including resources
        referenced in our Insights articles. These websites have their own
        privacy practices, and we encourage you to review their policies
        before providing any personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The
        "Last updated" date at the top of this page identifies the most
        recent revision.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how
        BlinkNetworks handles personal information, contact us:
      </p>
      <p>
        BlinkNetworks<br />
        Etobicoke, Ontario<br />
        <a href="mailto:hello@blinknetworks.com">hello@blinknetworks.com</a><br />
        <a href="tel:+19057037895">(905) 703-7895</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy {
    max-width: var(--container-max-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--container-padding-mobile);
    padding-block: 40px 56px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .privacy {
      padding-inline: var(--container-padding-tablet);
      padding-block: 44px 60px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .privacy {
      padding-inline: var(--container-padding-desktop);
      padding-block: 52px 72px;
    }
  }

  .privacy__header {
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }

  .privacy__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: var(--color-secondary-navy);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .privacy__heading {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .privacy__heading {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  .privacy__updated {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .privacy__content {
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .privacy__content h2 {
    margin: 2.25rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .privacy__content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .privacy__content p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .privacy__content ul {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .privacy__content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy__content a {
    color: var(--color-secondary-navy);
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .privacy__content a:hover,
  .privacy__content a:focus-visible {
    color: var(--color-blink-navy);
  }
</style>
